<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1046" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγχιστ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be next</i> or <i>near</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ ἀγχιστεύουσα . . πόντῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					224
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be next of kin, heir-at-law</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					11.11
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀγοραίης ἐργασίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Praec.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινά</span>
			<i>do a kinsman's office</i> to a woman, i.e. <i>marry</i> her,
				<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ru.</u>
				3.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.4
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κληρονομίαν ἀ.</span>”
				<i>enter upon . . , Nu.</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					36.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be excluded by descent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τῆς ἱερατείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Es.</u>
					2.62
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ne.</u>
				7.64
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
